WEBVTT

00:02.773 --> 00:03.330
(5 Days Before the Centennial Festival)

00:03.410 --> 00:06.580
"In the secret quest, there's a relic
that grants you a Dia skill."

00:06.660 --> 00:09.040
I'll kill the bastard
who spread that rumor

00:09.120 --> 00:10.540
with my own hands.

00:11.000 --> 00:12.630
Those who make me work overtime

00:12.710 --> 00:14.630
only have one end: death!

00:15.050 --> 00:17.970
Ms. Alina, you're so pumped up.

00:18.590 --> 00:20.840
Why are we dressed like this?

00:21.260 --> 00:22.260
Look at Lululi.

00:22.350 --> 00:24.970
She's like a walking shield with legs.

00:27.430 --> 00:28.640
That's what she said,

00:28.730 --> 00:30.150
Shield Monster.

00:30.230 --> 00:31.270
Lowe.

00:31.360 --> 00:33.860
I'll remember this!

00:34.400 --> 00:35.400
It seems like

00:35.480 --> 00:38.490
they're deliberately spreading
the rumor to novices.

00:38.990 --> 00:40.660
That's why we're in disguise

00:40.740 --> 00:43.870
and waiting for them to approach us.

00:45.910 --> 00:47.120
Even so,

00:47.410 --> 00:50.960
Ms. Alina has disguised herself
as a white mage responsible for healing

00:51.040 --> 00:52.630
What are you trying to say?

00:53.170 --> 00:54.590
Well, you see...

00:54.920 --> 00:56.590
When you first become an adventurer,

00:56.670 --> 00:59.170
even this set of equipment
will make you very happy,

00:59.260 --> 01:01.890
thinking, "I'm also an adventurer now."

01:01.970 --> 01:03.470
Right, Lululi?

01:03.550 --> 01:05.140
When I first become an adventurer?

01:05.930 --> 01:07.310
That's right.

01:10.060 --> 01:11.980
We're here, Ms. Alina.

01:12.770 --> 01:15.980
This is a C-class dungeon
for beginner adventurers.

01:16.320 --> 01:18.150
The Forest of Eternity.

01:24.240 --> 01:30.660
(I May Be a Guild Receptionist,
but I'll Solo Any Boss to Clock Out on Time)

02:55.000 --> 02:57.250
This is Mossy Rock Lake.

02:57.330 --> 02:58.670
Among adventurers,

02:58.750 --> 03:00.590
it's a famous rest area.

03:00.840 --> 03:03.420
The eyewitness accounts
of the rumor-spreaders

03:03.510 --> 03:05.380
are concentrated in this area.

03:05.760 --> 03:07.430
Let's take a break here.

03:07.510 --> 03:08.890
Roger.

03:08.970 --> 03:12.100
My shoulders are so stiff.

03:16.690 --> 03:18.020
By the way, Ms. Alina.

03:18.110 --> 03:19.110
What?

03:19.190 --> 03:21.070
Isn't this lake beautiful?

03:22.440 --> 03:25.400
A lot of people play a game
where they swim over to the mossy rock

03:25.490 --> 03:26.950
and then swim back.

03:27.280 --> 03:29.030
I'm not swimming.

03:29.280 --> 03:31.200
I thought so.

03:32.290 --> 03:34.910
Work seriously! Be more serious!

03:35.000 --> 03:36.540
I am.

03:36.620 --> 03:39.420
Sigurth Beast didn't respond at all.

03:46.590 --> 03:47.840
This feels so good!

03:47.930 --> 03:49.470
Let's swim together, Lululi.

03:49.760 --> 03:51.220
No way!

03:52.260 --> 03:53.560
Lowe!

03:53.640 --> 03:55.060
Hey, don't fall.

03:55.140 --> 03:56.560
You're treating me like a kid again!

03:56.640 --> 03:57.900
Didn't you say you're not swimming?

03:58.810 --> 04:01.070
This is payback for earlier!

04:01.730 --> 04:02.860
Wait.

04:03.900 --> 04:05.530
Take this!

04:09.240 --> 04:11.660
Ms. Alina in a swimsuit

04:12.530 --> 04:14.660
should be incredibly cute, right?

04:15.250 --> 04:18.709
Don't imagine what I look like
in a swimsuit on your own!

04:18.709 --> 04:22.880
You perverted Silver Sword bastard!

04:32.600 --> 04:35.020
The last time we chatted around a campfire

04:35.430 --> 04:37.560
felt like such a long time ago.

04:37.640 --> 04:40.480
It was for Lululi's
special training, right?

04:40.690 --> 04:41.980
Special training?

04:42.060 --> 04:43.360
Doesn't Silver Sword

04:43.440 --> 04:45.730
only accept strong adventurers?

04:45.990 --> 04:49.570
At that time,
my Sigurth skills had just manifested

04:49.660 --> 04:52.160
and we were also
getting used to each other.

04:52.240 --> 04:54.740
Back then, she'd get startled
by suddenly appearing monsters,

04:54.830 --> 04:57.750
causing her to fall
and heal herself afterward.

04:58.660 --> 05:01.880
Didn't I say not to bring this up,
or I won’t forgive you?

05:02.420 --> 05:04.550
- All right.
- I'm going to get mad.

05:04.630 --> 05:07.920
You've become a very reliable healer now.

05:08.170 --> 05:12.090
I just have amazing skills.

05:12.930 --> 05:15.140
Inherently, I have nothing...

05:15.560 --> 05:16.520
Don't worry.

05:16.600 --> 05:17.850
You just need to do

05:17.930 --> 05:20.440
what feels natural to you.

05:20.770 --> 05:22.230
That'll be enough.

05:22.310 --> 05:23.230
That's right.

05:23.310 --> 05:25.940
Be confident in your job.

05:31.530 --> 05:32.530
Someone's here.

05:41.920 --> 05:44.630
Hi, are you resting here too?

05:44.880 --> 05:45.880
Yes.

05:46.170 --> 05:48.090
We're doing combat training here

05:48.170 --> 05:50.170
because we want to get stronger.

05:50.260 --> 05:53.590
We're here to take a break too.

05:54.350 --> 05:57.100
I'm Heitz. Nice to meet you.

05:57.510 --> 05:59.220
Nice to meet you too.

06:01.890 --> 06:05.060
Actually, we also want to go
to a more profitable dungeon.

06:05.150 --> 06:07.270
But we're not making much progress.

06:08.860 --> 06:11.860
It was the same
when we first became adventurers.

06:12.150 --> 06:13.070
If

06:13.160 --> 06:16.160
you could become stronger
in an instant without training,

06:16.240 --> 06:17.740
would you want to try it?

06:17.830 --> 06:20.620
That sounds like a fantasy.

06:20.700 --> 06:23.710
It's not entirely a fantasy.

06:24.420 --> 06:27.750
Have you heard of secret quests?

06:27.840 --> 06:29.550
Secret quests?

06:29.630 --> 06:33.300
I heard that if you accept a secret quest,
a hidden dungeon will appear

06:33.380 --> 06:35.720
and you'll be given a special relic.

06:36.180 --> 06:39.560
And it's the relic that allows
the manifestation of Dia skills.

06:40.020 --> 06:41.600
Dia skills?

06:41.980 --> 06:42.980
That's right.

06:43.060 --> 06:45.560
It's the most powerful skill
that has been lost.

06:45.900 --> 06:48.150
Don't you guys want it?

06:48.230 --> 06:49.980
Of course, we do.

06:51.320 --> 06:52.280
But

06:52.360 --> 06:53.530
is it true?

06:59.540 --> 07:02.410
Jade Scrade of Silver Sword?

07:12.670 --> 07:14.470
The ones spreading the rumor

07:14.550 --> 07:15.840
are you, right?

07:16.260 --> 07:18.930
Is this how you incited Rufus?

07:19.010 --> 07:20.260
Rufus?

07:20.680 --> 07:22.220
I don't know who you're talking about.

07:22.310 --> 07:24.940
We merely heard it from someone.

07:25.020 --> 07:26.560
Who told you that?

07:26.650 --> 07:29.360
Oh no, I've said too much.

07:36.860 --> 07:39.660
I didn't think the higher-ups
would send you here for a mere rumor.

07:39.740 --> 07:42.200
Looks like Silver Sword
is pretty free, right?

07:51.210 --> 07:53.840
You bunch of rumor-mongering scumbags!

07:54.550 --> 07:56.720
That warhammer.

07:57.260 --> 07:58.840
Are you the Executioner?

07:59.090 --> 08:01.010
Because of you guys,

08:01.390 --> 08:04.600
the Centennial Festival
I've been looking forward to

08:04.680 --> 08:06.890
is going to be destroyed.

08:07.900 --> 08:09.270
You rumor-mongering bastards,

08:09.360 --> 08:10.270
I'll slaughter you all!

08:10.360 --> 08:11.480
Wait! Capture them alive!

08:11.570 --> 08:12.520
Like I care!

08:12.610 --> 08:14.490
Die!

08:14.570 --> 08:16.950
(Spatial Transcendent)
Skill Activate. Sigurth Mover!

08:19.780 --> 08:22.160
It's a spatial teleportation-type skill.

08:25.580 --> 08:28.330
Did he get away?

08:31.590 --> 08:32.582
A one-eyed,

08:32.582 --> 08:32.880
A one-eyed,
one-armed adventurer?

08:32.880 --> 08:35.418
one-armed adventurer?

08:36.970 --> 08:38.220
Aiden.

08:38.418 --> 08:39.418
Do you know him?

08:40.260 --> 08:43.760
He's an old companion of mine.

08:50.150 --> 08:51.860
Well, well.

08:51.940 --> 08:54.440
It's been a while, Ms. Healer.

08:55.110 --> 08:57.280
Why are you doing this?

08:57.610 --> 09:00.450
What are you trying to do
by spreading the rumor like this?

09:00.700 --> 09:02.370
It's not a rumor.

09:02.450 --> 09:05.160
Dia skills really do exist.

09:05.660 --> 09:06.870
Besides,

09:06.950 --> 09:10.670
who are you to patronize me
with this high and mighty attitude?

09:10.750 --> 09:13.210
Murderer Lululi!

09:15.420 --> 09:17.090
Murderer?

09:18.340 --> 09:21.550
You guys are going to die eventually
if you keep this shorty.

09:21.640 --> 09:24.180
After all, she's a killer healer

09:24.260 --> 09:27.020
who can abandon her comrades
without batting an eye!

09:29.390 --> 09:33.110
Who cares about that, you third-rate scum?

09:33.980 --> 09:35.690
I told you just now.

09:35.770 --> 09:38.320
I'm going to kill all of you
rumor-mongering bastards.

09:38.400 --> 09:39.990
Hang on.

09:40.070 --> 09:42.280
I'm about to expose her past.

09:42.360 --> 09:43.740
Shut up!

09:43.820 --> 09:45.830
Die!

09:45.910 --> 09:48.250
Wait! Wait! Wait!

09:57.760 --> 10:00.670
(4 Days Before the Centennial Festival)

10:05.510 --> 10:09.180
We already know someone's been
spreading the rumor behind the scenes

10:09.270 --> 10:12.770
but I guess we can't put an end
to this chaos right away.

10:12.850 --> 10:14.560
No, Ms. Alina.

10:14.650 --> 10:16.190
More importantly,

10:16.480 --> 10:19.650
why is Lord Jade helping
with our overtime work here?

10:19.740 --> 10:22.280
And he's handling it perfectly.

10:22.660 --> 10:26.740
I did it in exchange for a one-day date
with Ms. Alina at the Centennial Festival!

10:27.580 --> 10:29.580
Date?!

10:29.660 --> 10:31.120
That's not important right now.

10:31.210 --> 10:32.370
Let's quickly organize...

10:32.460 --> 10:33.750
I...

10:33.830 --> 10:35.830
I am so happy!

10:35.920 --> 10:36.920
What?

10:37.000 --> 10:38.920
Ms. Alina is no doubt a beauty,

10:39.000 --> 10:40.340
but should I say she lacks feminine charm?

10:40.420 --> 10:41.720
Even if a guy asks her out,

10:41.800 --> 10:44.260
she just firmly rejects him with a fake smile.

10:44.340 --> 10:48.470
She's been working herself to the bone
every day, so I'm really worried!

10:48.560 --> 10:50.270
Hey, do you take me for a fool?

10:50.350 --> 10:51.520
Wait a minute!

10:51.600 --> 10:53.980
Did you just say other guys asked her out?

10:54.230 --> 10:55.690
That's so nice.

10:55.770 --> 10:57.560
She'll probably retire to get married.

10:57.650 --> 10:59.150
It's like a Cinderella story.

10:59.230 --> 11:02.320
Why do I have to marry this guy?

11:02.400 --> 11:03.240
What?

11:03.320 --> 11:04.700
This is Lord Jade we're talking about!

11:04.990 --> 11:06.240
Not only is he a cutie with a great body,

11:06.320 --> 11:09.120
but he's also a regular
on the Wealthiest Adventurers List!

11:09.200 --> 11:11.450
Is there a reason not to marry him?

11:12.830 --> 11:13.960
Listen up.

11:14.040 --> 11:15.370
In this world,

11:15.460 --> 11:18.170
there are some pleasures
that money can't buy.

11:19.170 --> 11:21.800
Like desserts after hard work

11:21.880 --> 11:24.010
and late-night indulgences
the night before your day off.

11:24.090 --> 11:25.800
That's so insignificant.

11:26.430 --> 11:31.470
I'm not a frivolous person who wants
to live off other people's money.

11:31.850 --> 11:35.730
Why do you like Ms. Alina?

11:36.270 --> 11:39.060
Her stubborn nature
and that ill-fated side of hers

11:39.150 --> 11:40.730
really draw me in.

11:46.410 --> 11:48.240
I can't open my eyes.

11:48.320 --> 11:50.950
Let's call it a day.

11:51.240 --> 11:52.450
No...

11:52.870 --> 11:55.290
I'm going to get some fresh air.

11:55.500 --> 11:58.040
Lyra, you can go home now.

11:58.290 --> 12:01.460
Okay. Good work, Ms. Alina.

12:03.760 --> 12:06.470
I don't know how long
she's going to work overtime.

12:06.550 --> 12:10.100
I'll stay with her until the end,
so don't worry.

12:15.770 --> 12:17.230
Ms. Alina

12:17.310 --> 12:19.150
is actually a very kind person.

12:19.440 --> 12:21.320
Not only does she always help me,

12:21.400 --> 12:23.610
but she also often works overtime with me.

12:23.900 --> 12:24.940
It's just that

12:25.030 --> 12:28.240
she's too used
to doing everything on her own.

12:28.610 --> 12:30.160
I know

12:30.240 --> 12:31.620
she's actually really kind.

12:32.330 --> 12:33.990
Lord Jade.

12:34.080 --> 12:37.160
Please support Ms. Alina well.

12:38.460 --> 12:40.290
No matter what happens

12:40.380 --> 12:42.090
from now on.

12:44.210 --> 12:46.800
Yes, I intend to.

12:46.880 --> 12:47.720
Well then,

12:47.800 --> 12:50.140
I don't want to be a third wheel
in your love nest anymore.

12:50.220 --> 12:52.550
I'll be going now.

12:58.850 --> 13:02.520
I have to become stronger.

13:05.030 --> 13:07.440
An adventurer named the Executioner

13:07.530 --> 13:09.660
defeated the Dark God Silha.

13:10.070 --> 13:11.240
(Adventurer Guild, Audience Hall)
However,

13:11.320 --> 13:14.240
in the face of the dark god
capable of using multiple Dia skills,

13:14.490 --> 13:17.830
how did the Executioner win?

13:17.910 --> 13:21.580
We can't rely on unknown powers.

13:21.670 --> 13:23.590
I understand.

13:23.670 --> 13:24.500
Firstly,

13:24.590 --> 13:27.970
who is this Executioner?

13:28.920 --> 13:30.930
I'm very sorry.

13:31.010 --> 13:35.640
I want to respect his wishes
as much as possible.

13:35.720 --> 13:37.310
His wish?

13:37.890 --> 13:40.810
To live a peaceful life.

13:40.890 --> 13:45.900
Seems like he wishes to live
in a place untouched by battle.

13:57.240 --> 13:58.870
Murderer.

13:58.950 --> 14:01.580
Why didn't you treat them?

14:01.670 --> 14:04.920
Murderer...

14:10.220 --> 14:11.380
Jade!

14:11.800 --> 14:13.840
Murderer!

14:25.480 --> 14:26.610
No...

14:26.690 --> 14:29.650
No!

14:39.160 --> 14:41.500
(3 Days Before the Centennial Festival)

14:42.870 --> 14:46.250
He said he wanted us to help
with a dangerous special training.

14:46.340 --> 14:49.630
What is our leader trying to do?

14:50.050 --> 14:51.260
Well...

14:52.470 --> 14:54.180
Aren't you going to ask me?

14:54.260 --> 14:55.510
That...

14:56.100 --> 14:57.640
The fact that

14:57.720 --> 14:59.350
he said I'm a murderer.

15:00.720 --> 15:01.730
That kind of thing

15:01.810 --> 15:03.230
isn't important at all.

15:07.480 --> 15:09.820
(Adventurer's Guild Headquarters)

15:12.360 --> 15:15.410
What Aiden said was true!

15:16.700 --> 15:19.410
The tank of the first party I joined

15:19.490 --> 15:21.370
was Aiden.

15:21.450 --> 15:22.450
At that time,

15:22.540 --> 15:24.830
my Sigurth skills hadn't manifested yet.

15:24.920 --> 15:26.500
All right, all right.

15:26.790 --> 15:29.210
I'll listen to you, okay?

15:30.710 --> 15:32.010
That day,

15:32.260 --> 15:36.140
we arrived at the boss' room
for the first time.

15:36.680 --> 15:38.800
We were so happy that we accidentally…

15:38.890 --> 15:40.680
got carried away.

15:41.390 --> 15:44.560
We challenged the floor boss directly.

15:49.480 --> 15:51.070
In the end,

15:51.150 --> 15:53.990
everyone fell one by one.

15:54.700 --> 15:56.860
The black mage and the swordsman

15:56.950 --> 15:58.820
were gravely injured and near death.

15:59.410 --> 16:02.580
But at that time,
I was still inexperienced with my magic.

16:03.000 --> 16:05.790
If I used all the magic power I had left,

16:05.870 --> 16:07.790
I could save one of them.

16:08.420 --> 16:10.460
But the other one would...

16:11.000 --> 16:13.260
So I had to choose

16:13.340 --> 16:14.970
which one to save.

16:16.510 --> 16:20.550
But I couldn't choose.

16:21.640 --> 16:25.180
So I ended up healing them
both half-heartedly.

16:26.020 --> 16:29.690
And they both died.

16:29.770 --> 16:31.570
I see.

16:31.650 --> 16:34.360
That's why he called you a murderer.

16:36.530 --> 16:37.610
Of course.

16:37.910 --> 16:40.990
You might not have been
strong enough back then.

16:41.410 --> 16:43.580
But a tank
who couldn't protect his comrades

16:43.660 --> 16:45.700
and an attacker
who couldn't defeat the boss

16:45.790 --> 16:47.250
were also at fault, right?

16:47.330 --> 16:48.250
But!

16:48.330 --> 16:49.330
A healer's job

16:49.420 --> 16:51.460
is to heal everyone.

16:52.460 --> 16:53.920
But

16:54.000 --> 16:57.090
I couldn't do it properly.

16:57.800 --> 16:58.680
Then,

16:58.760 --> 17:01.970
if I told you that I'm a murderer too,
what would you do?

17:02.890 --> 17:05.164
You're talking nonsense again.

17:06.358 --> 17:07.164
Would you still be

17:07.480 --> 17:10.164
in the same party as me, like before?

17:12.836 --> 17:14.020
If it were you,

17:14.358 --> 17:17.740
I'd think that there must be a reason
why you had to do that.

17:18.358 --> 17:19.780
So,

17:19.780 --> 17:19.836
So,
I'll still trust you.

17:19.836 --> 17:22.164
I'll still trust you.

17:24.450 --> 17:26.700
Then I believe in you too.

17:29.370 --> 17:31.540
Rather than what that guy said,

17:31.630 --> 17:34.880
I trust what I see in you more.

17:51.850 --> 17:54.570
What are you doing?

17:59.900 --> 18:00.820
Jade!

18:00.910 --> 18:01.990
Leader!

18:04.370 --> 18:06.870
(Adventurer Guild, Research Building)
- Simultaneous skill activation?
- Simultaneous skill activation?

18:07.200 --> 18:11.000
If I could activate the Sigurth Wall
and the Sigurth Blood at the same time,

18:11.080 --> 18:14.170
I'd be able to boost my power
to an unimaginable level.

18:14.460 --> 18:16.210
Are you stupid?

18:16.300 --> 18:17.670
Do you know how much strain

18:17.760 --> 18:20.760
it puts on your body
to use multiple skills simultaneously?

18:21.090 --> 18:23.680
Did you cause that commotion just now?

18:25.350 --> 18:26.810
Shelley!

18:31.230 --> 18:34.190
The side effect of excessive skill use

18:34.560 --> 18:37.440
should be in the second stage now, right?

18:38.320 --> 18:41.780
This person is totally treating me
like a guinea pig.

18:42.150 --> 18:43.320
In the third stage,

18:43.410 --> 18:45.820
you'll experience anomalies
like confusion and sensory distortions.

18:45.910 --> 18:47.740
If you continue to use it,

18:47.830 --> 18:49.120
sometimes you'll suffer physical damage

18:49.200 --> 18:50.120
and die from shock

18:50.200 --> 18:52.250
or you'll bleed to death.

18:53.210 --> 18:56.630
Hey, don't scare her like that.

18:56.960 --> 18:59.170
I think you'll be good research material.

18:59.260 --> 19:02.010
Keep up the good work and aim for the sky.

19:02.220 --> 19:06.470
That's why she's an authority
on skill and relic research.

19:07.180 --> 19:08.510
That's right.

19:08.600 --> 19:10.390
I'm here because of this.

19:13.270 --> 19:15.690
Wait, isn't this the Dark God's heart?

19:15.770 --> 19:17.230
Did you figure something out?

19:17.310 --> 19:18.520
Yes.

19:18.610 --> 19:20.900
This is the god core.

19:20.990 --> 19:23.400
To be precise, it's the main body.

19:23.820 --> 19:25.200
The main body?

19:25.280 --> 19:26.120
At first glance,

19:26.200 --> 19:29.370
doesn't it look like a black rock?

19:29.450 --> 19:31.120
But that's not its color.

19:31.200 --> 19:32.540
The reason it looks black

19:32.620 --> 19:36.460
is because it's filled
with countless magic sigils.

19:36.540 --> 19:37.750
Could all these

19:37.840 --> 19:38.960
be Dia skills?

19:39.380 --> 19:42.460
The Dark God Silha
can only use three skills.

19:42.550 --> 19:43.510
My guess is

19:43.590 --> 19:45.680
the number of souls he consumes

19:45.760 --> 19:48.300
might be equal to the number
of skills he can use.

19:49.260 --> 19:51.600
So the more people he kills,

19:51.680 --> 19:54.520
the more Dia skills he can gain
and become stronger.

19:55.060 --> 19:57.690
If this thing appears near the town,

19:59.230 --> 20:02.940
my goodness, humanity would be doomed!

20:03.280 --> 20:04.400
Hey...

20:04.490 --> 20:07.490
How could you say
something so scary casually?

20:07.990 --> 20:09.620
Any other intel?

20:10.330 --> 20:12.910
I did get some information
from the rumor-spreading culprit.

20:13.000 --> 20:15.790
The source seems
to be a man dressed in black.

20:15.870 --> 20:17.370
A man dressed in black?

20:17.460 --> 20:20.750
He was wearing a long black robe
to hide his face.

20:20.840 --> 20:23.260
Other than the voice
sounding like a man's,

20:23.340 --> 20:25.470
there's nothing else.

20:25.930 --> 20:27.890
A man in black?

20:28.180 --> 20:30.640
We have to figure something out quickly.

20:31.890 --> 20:33.850
(The Day Before the Centennial Festival)

20:33.930 --> 20:37.190
It's over!

20:37.270 --> 20:38.400
Thank you for your hard work.

20:38.480 --> 20:40.360
Besides, this year's Centennial Festival

20:40.440 --> 20:42.980
doesn't have a special bonus period.

20:43.070 --> 20:44.690
That's right.

20:44.780 --> 20:48.820
It's also a penalty for those who ignored
the warning and got led by the rumor.

20:49.110 --> 20:52.370
I won. I absolutely won.

20:52.580 --> 20:55.750
Now I can finally participate
in the Centennial Festival!

20:55.830 --> 20:57.000
And

20:57.080 --> 20:59.960
I can fulfill my wish
of going on a date with Ms. Alina.

21:00.040 --> 21:01.540
Well then, let's go.

21:01.630 --> 21:02.630
What?

21:02.710 --> 21:04.090
What do you mean, "What?"

21:04.210 --> 21:07.630
After escaping from overtime hell,
there's only one thing to do.

21:07.880 --> 21:09.340
It's to drink!

21:09.640 --> 21:10.640
What?

21:11.140 --> 21:14.810
What?

21:18.480 --> 21:20.190
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

21:35.370 --> 21:37.710
Well, it's bound to turn out like this.

21:38.160 --> 21:40.420
After all, she's been
working overtime this whole time.

21:40.500 --> 21:42.540
Centennial Festival.

21:43.840 --> 21:45.000
Ms. Alina.

21:45.090 --> 21:46.550
Let's go home for today.

21:46.670 --> 21:48.090
Can you stand?

21:49.590 --> 21:51.220
Shroud?

21:51.300 --> 21:52.300
What?

21:52.800 --> 21:56.270
Shroud, you're back?

21:56.600 --> 21:57.810
I've become

21:57.890 --> 22:00.230
a receptionist, you know.

22:00.310 --> 22:03.610
I've been waiting for you

22:03.690 --> 22:06.440
to take on quests at my counter.

22:07.690 --> 22:09.400
Shroud.

22:09.820 --> 22:12.700
That's a man's name, right?

22:13.450 --> 22:15.240
She's been...

22:15.580 --> 22:17.410
waiting for Shroud?

23:53.170 --> 23:54.010
Next episode.

23:54.090 --> 23:56.180
Since it's the long-awaited
Centennial Festival,

23:56.260 --> 23:59.470
I'll definitely enjoy it to the fullest.

23:59.470 --> 24:01.470
(Next Episode: Since it's the long-awaited Centennial
Festival, I'll definitely enjoy it to the fullest)
